'{"correctFeedback":"An outcome describes a user or business behavior/result rather than the artifact shipped.","incorrectFeedback":"Distinguish the change you want to create from the feature or task you produce."}'::jsonb,
'["product-strategy","outcomes"]'::jsonb,'SEEDED','role-bank-h1',true),
('72000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000042','10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031','segmentation','MCQ',2,
'Why is a clearly defined target user segment useful in product strategy?',
'[{"id":"a","text":"It makes needs, tradeoffs, and positioning more specific"},{"id":"b","text":"It guarantees every user wants the same thing"},{"id":"c","text":"It removes the need to validate assumptions"},{"id":"d","text":"It makes metrics unnecessary"}]'::jsonb,
'{"correctOptionId":"a"}'::jsonb,
'{"correctFeedback":"A specific segment helps the team reason about concrete needs and tradeoffs.","incorrectFeedback":"Segmentation narrows the problem space; it does not eliminate uncertainty."}'::jsonb,
'["product-strategy","segmentation"]'::jsonb,'SEEDED','role-bank-h1',true),
('72000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000043','10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031','north-star','MCQ',2,
'What is a useful property of a North Star metric?',
'[{"id":"a","text":"It reflects recurring value delivered to customers and connects to sustainable product success"},{"id":"b","text":"It must always be total page views"},{"id":"c","text":"It should change only once a year"},{"id":"d","text":"It replaces all guardrail metrics"}]'::jsonb,
'{"correctOptionId":"a"}'::jsonb,
'{"correctFeedback":"A useful North Star metric connects customer value with durable product progress.","incorrectFeedback":"The metric should represent delivered value, not merely a convenient activity count."}'::jsonb,
